{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/extras/643a2dca270e79dba6d4253ece61d3b6.webp?t=1764340574\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Bell \u2014 a mystical horror adventure inspired by an ancient legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Mark, a folklorist trapped in a series of cursed places \u2014 from a foggy village to an abandoned city, underground halls, and a hellish maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter holds its own goal, threat, and atmosphere. Sometimes you\u2019ll need to seek mystical gifts, and sometimes \u2014 simply survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 chapters, each with unique mechanics and tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relentless Reaper follows you with every toll of the bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments \u2014 from dense fog to burning corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival tools \u2014 the locator, sprint, and light will only help you for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomness and tension \u2014 events and key item locations change each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since its release, The Fifth Bell has grown significantly: lighting improvements, new chapters, reworked atmosphere, and smarter enemy behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story now unveils more about the curse and the fate of those who failed to survive the Fifth Toll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you endure all the chapters and hear the final bell... or remain in its shadow?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What do we have here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4040030/aa33e353dbe7659d772728a69cf47b80ed0868e0.jpg"},{"name":"Photo with a star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/