andomness and tension \u2014 events and key item locations change each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since its release, The Fifth Bell has grown significantly: lighting improvements, new chapters, reworked atmosphere, and smarter enemy behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story now unveils more about the curse and the fate of those who failed to survive the Fifth Toll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you endure all the chapters and hear the final bell... or remain in its shadow?</p>","developers":["Loop Nexus Games "],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/f9e075bebaf2e0b266b074d279452cbeee20caf9/header.jpg?t=1764340574","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040030/664944873/7c6bbbf526c633a53bbfb47efc0f905c663de803/1762361501/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762361873","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040030/664944873/7c6bbbf526c633a53bbfb47efc0f905c663de803/1762361501/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762361873","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040030/664944873/7c6bbbf526c633a53bbfb47efc0f905c663de803/1762361501/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762361873","id":257198702,"name":"Tfe Fifth Bell ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198702/5d2bdf9965bff409774c41e23ca1fa030b0217b4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762361873"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040030/1683612268/fae4693d5e9eff5dc3f1fd74b21bcbec8442f675/1762550885/dash_av1.mpd?t=17